WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.440
This is a busy shipping
lane and at any moment

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.250
something could go
wrong.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.780
It only takes one
incident to literally

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.530
send this ordinance two
miles up into the air.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.040
It has the potential to
be one of the largest

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.580
non-nuclear explosions
in the history of

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.540
mankind.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.200
London and satellite
towns like Sheerness on

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.790
the coast face a deadly
threat.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.490
The population could have
a casualty rate far

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.650
higher than anything it
suffered in the Second

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:35.430
World War.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:43.410
Yet a one and a half kill
a ton blast isn't the

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.720
only thing that could
devastate London.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:49.920
Worst case scenario, this
ordinance blows and

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.300
causes a tsunami.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.050
Some analysts have
concluded it would race

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.870
up the Thames and smash
into the centre of

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:58.290
London.

